        "amp_sustain": 0
      },
      "notes": "amp_attack: sharp finger pluck\namp_decay: honest ParamDef max (was 8, silently clamped to 4 in the recipe path); long natural ring-down\namp_sustain: PLUCKS AND DECAYS"
    },
